  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shelter and Emergency Assistance to respond to Multisectorial needs of Affected Population in north-Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This emergency project seeks to address these critical needs by focusing on four key areas of intervention: shelter repairs for collective shelters, distribution of educational kits for displaced children, comprehensive package of non-food items (NFIs) including hygiene &amp; MHM kits as well as baby kits for HHs, and providing cash for shelter for displaced HHs paying rent in residential units and apartments.</narrative>
  </description>
